#EXTM3U
# IPTV Series — Hindi / Hindi Dubbed Web Series
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Is file mein series ke episode links daalo — app har 24 ghante GitHub
# se khud refresh kar legi, naya APK lagane ki zaroorat nahi hogi.
# Format (har episode ke liye 2 lines):
#   #EXTINF:-1 group-title="Loki",Loki S01E01 [Hindi Dubbed] [1080p]
#   https://.../...mp4   (ya .m3u8 link)
# Sirf HD links (720p/1080p) — cinema recording wale links mat daalo.
# group-title mein series ka naam likho taa ke episodes aik jagah milen.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Abhi is file mein koi series link nahi hai — jab koi working HD link
# mile to upar wale format mein yahan add kar do.
